Q.62 Consider the following C program: 
#include <stdio.h> 
int main(){  
int a; 
int arr[5] = {30,50,10}; 
int *ptr; 
ptr = &arr[0] + 1; 
a = *ptr; 
(*ptr)++; 
ptr++; 
printf("%d", a + (*ptr) + arr[1]); 
return 0; 
} 
The output of the above program is ___________. (Answer in integer) 


